# --- Listing scraper (Apify) -------------------------------------------------
# The /api/scrape route runs ready-made Apify actors that return structured
# listing data, so we don't fetch HTML or fight DataDome ourselves.
#
#   Leboncoin → scrapifier/leboncoin-universal-scraper
#   SeLoger   → azzouzana/seloger-mass-products-scraper-by-items-urls
#
# Get a token at https://console.apify.com/account/integrations, then set it
# here. Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill it in (never commit .env.local).
APIFY_TOKEN=

# Optional — override the actor IDs if they ever change (use ~ or /):
# APIFY_LEBONCOIN_ACTOR=scrapifier~leboncoin-universal-scraper
# APIFY_SELOGER_ACTOR=azzouzana~seloger-mass-products-scraper-by-items-urls
